{"created": "2020-01-31T07:16:50.180302+00:00", "modified": "2020-01-31T09:29:33.725381+00:00", "id": 3632035, "conceptrecid": "3632034", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3632035", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.3632034", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3632035", "metadata": {"title": "BACH Dataset : Grand Challenge on Breast Cancer Histology images", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3632035", "publication_date": "2019-05-31", "description": "<p><strong>i3S Annotated Datasets on Digital Pathology</strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>WELCOME</strong></p>\n\n<p>In an effort to contribute and push forward the field of Digital Pathology,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ipatimup.pt/\">Ipatimup</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.ineb.up.pt/\">INEB</a>, two major research institutions in Portugal,&nbsp;have joined forces in the construction of histology datasets to support grand Challenges on automatic classification of tissue malignancy. The researchers/pathologists responsible for the datasets are:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"mailto:apolonia@ipatimup.pt\">Ant&oacute;nio Pol&oacute;nia</a>&nbsp;(MD), Ipatimup/i3S</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"mailto:celoy@ipatimup.pt\">Catarina Eloy</a>&nbsp;(MD, PhD), Ipatimup/i3S</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"mailto:pauloaguiar@ineb.up.pt\">Paulo Aguiar</a>&nbsp;(PhD), INEB/i3S</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>This specific page refers to the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://iciar2018-challenge.grand-challenge.org/home/\">Grand Challenge on Breast Cancer Histology images</a>, or&nbsp;BACH Challenge</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>THE BACH CHALLENGE DATASET</strong></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://iciar2018-challenge.grand-challenge.org/home/\">ICIAR 2018 - Grand Challenge on Breast Cancer Histology images</a>&nbsp;[Challenge organized by Teresa Ara&uacute;jo, Guilherme Aresta, Ant&oacute;nio Pol&oacute;nia, Catarina Eloy and Paulo Aguiar]</p>\n\n<p>For detailed information visit:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://iciar2018-challenge.grand-challenge.org/home/\">https://iciar2018-challenge.grand-challenge.org/home/</a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>THIS&nbsp;DATASET&nbsp;IS&nbsp;PUBLICALLY AVAILABLE&nbsp;UNDER A CREATIVE COMMONS CC BY-NC-ND LICENSE (<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode\">ATTRIBUTION-NONCOMMERCIAL-NODERIVS</a>)<br>\nESSENCIALLY, YOU ARE GRANTED ACCESS TO THE DATASET&nbsp;FOR USE IN YOUR RESEARCH AS LONG AS YOU CREDIT OUR WORK/PUBLICATIONS(*),&nbsp;BUT YOU CANNOT CHANGE THEM IN ANY WAY OR USE THEM COMMERCIALLY</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>(*) Aresta, Guilherme, et al. &quot;BACH: Grand challenge on breast cancer histology images.&quot; Medical image analysis (2019).</li>\n\t<li>(*) Ara&uacute;jo, Teresa, et al. &quot;Classification of breast cancer histology images using convolutional neural networks.&quot; PloS one 12.6 (2017): e0177544.</li>\n\t<li>(*) Fond&oacute;n, Irene, et al. &quot;Automatic classification of tissue malignancy for breast carcinoma diagnosis.&quot; Computers in biology and medicine 96 (2018): 41-51.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Pol\u00f3nia, Ant\u00f3nio", "affiliation": "IPATIMUP/i3S", "orcid": "0000-0001-8312-1681"}, {"name": "Eloy, Catarina", "affiliation": "IPATIMUP/i3S", "orcid": "0000-0001-7642-1280"}, {"name": "Aguiar, Paulo", "affiliation": "INEB/i3S", "orcid": "0000-0003-4164-5713"}], "keywords": ["Breast cancer", "Histology", "Digital pathology", "Challenge", "Machine learning", "Deep learning"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1016/j.media.2019.05.010", "relation": "isDocumentedBy", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"pages": "122-139", "title": "Medical Image Analysis", "volume": "56"}, "meeting": {"title": "15th International Conference on Image Analysis and Recognition", "acronym": "ICIAR", "dates": "June 27-29, 2018", "place": "P\u00f3voa de Varzim, Portugal", "url": "https://www.aimiconf.org/iciar18/"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-nc-nd-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "grand-challenge"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "3632034"}}]}}, "title": "BACH Dataset : Grand Challenge on Breast Cancer Histology images", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3632035", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3632035?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3632035", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3632035", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.3632035", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632034", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3632034", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3632034", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.3632034", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:3632035/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:3632035/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3632035/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3632035/communities-suggestions", "request_del